        "TileImage": "$($repository 86735af3-2178-4de9-b78b-8ea6dd79b786).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47,  your targets are con artists Victoria Cole and Morgan Fleming and programmer Alexander Hoffman, they&apos;ve joined forces to create and promote a spyware which instantly directs data to an unknown client of theirs.\r\rOur client, a PI who believes there is something more sinister going on here has asked us to prevent the spyware from releasing and to investigate this mystery customer.  Don&apos;t worry 47,  I&apos;ll take care of this last bit myself.\r\rGood luck 47, I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
